# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored (root .gitignore: **/.env).
#
# NAMES ONLY IN THIS FILE — never a real value.
#
# Everything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the app bundle and is
# readable by anyone who unpacks the build. Only genuinely public values belong
# here. No API key, no secret, no token — ever.

# Base URL of the MPX backend — its ROOT, with no /api prefix.
# The backend mounts routes at root (/auth/login, /products, ...). The web app's
# /api prefix is a Vite dev-proxy convention that strips it again; the app has no
# proxy, so it talks to the backend directly.
#
# Production and staging MUST be https:// — src/config/env.js throws otherwise.
# In a local dev build only, http:// is accepted against localhost or a private
# LAN address:
#   iOS simulator     http://localhost:3000
#   Android emulator  http://10.0.2.2:3000
#   physical device   http://<your-machine-LAN-IP>:3000
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
